        "@type": "etymon:Etymology",
        "etymon:derivedFrom": "nater",
        "etymon:note": "Grammaticalized from nater 'desire, intended course', from early lexicalized Proto-Hick *nateru < *naru teru 'action-flow, course of action'.",
